      "bottomRightY": 137,
      "content": "$$[H^a, \\psi_{nk}^{(1)}] - \\frac{h^2}{8\\pi^2\\mu} \\Delta\\psi_{nk}^{(1)} - W_{nk}^0 \\psi_{nk}^{(1)} = -U \\psi_{nk}^0.$$",
